@startuml observer_solution
title Observer - rozwiazanie: luznie powiazan przez interfejs

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150

interface IObserver {
    + Update(temperature: float, humidity: float)
}

interface ISubject {
    + Subscribe(observer: IObserver)
    + Unsubscribe(observer: IObserver)
    + NotifyAll()
}

class WeatherStation {
    - observers: List<IObserver>
    - temperature: float
    - humidity: float
    + Subscribe(observer)
    + Unsubscribe(observer)
    + NotifyAll()
    + SetMeasurements(t, h)
}

class CurrentConditionsDisplay {
    + Update(t, h)
}

class StatisticsDisplay {
    + Update(t, h)
}

class ForecastDisplay {
    + Update(t, h)
}

class MobileAppDisplay {
    + Update(t, h)
}

ISubject <|.. WeatherStation
IObserver <|.. CurrentConditionsDisplay
IObserver <|.. StatisticsDisplay
IObserver <|.. ForecastDisplay
IObserver <|.. MobileAppDisplay

WeatherStation o--> "0..*" IObserver : notyfikuje przez interfejs

note right of WeatherStation
WeatherStation zna tylko IObserver.
Nowy wyswietlacz = nowa klasa,
zero zmian w WeatherStation.
end note

@enduml
